// Source: Cpp1 habits and typos that are not Cpp2 tokens: a stray backtick,
// a `#` inside an expression, a non-ASCII character, an escaped `\(`
// interpolation (expressions.md: `(expr)$`), and an unterminated string.
// expect-error: unexpected text '`'
// expect-error: unexpected text '#'
// expect-error: unexpected text 'é'
// expect-error: no matching ( for string interpolation ending in )$
// expect-error: string literal is missing its closing "
main: () = {
    x := 1 ` 2;
    y := 1 # 2;
    z := 1 é 2;
    s := "\(x)$";
    t := "open;
}
